(e) in Column 4— enter the following:
(i) the name of the offence;
(ii) the date of the offence;
(iii) the time of the offence; and
(iv) the place of the offence;
(f) in Column 5—enter the following:
(i) the final classification of the offence at the
top space;
(ii) the statutory reference of the offence
reported in the space provided; and
(iii) between (a) and (b), classification letter
and A.O.S. No. of the offence to date, in
red ink;
(g) in Column 6—enter the number, rank, name and
station address of the complainant;
(h) in Column 7—enter the name, address and Driving
Permit number of the driver and the
vehicle number;
(i) in Column 8—enter—
(i) the number, rank and name of the
Police Officer detecting the offence
and particulars of action taken with
respect to the issuing of the Notice
of Fixed Penalty and/or receiving
instructions;
(ii) name and address of person prosecuted;
and
(iii) dates of court hearing;
